	<section_number>38.2-4228</section_number>
	<catch_line>Controversies involving subscription contracts</catch_line>
	<text>
		The Commission shall have no jurisdiction to adjudicate controversies growing out of subscription contracts. A breach of contract shall not be deemed a violation of this chapter.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 32-195.20; 1956, c. 268, § 38.1-833; 1979, c. 721; 1986, c. 562.</history>
